WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:03.544
BondTrace makes corporate actions traceable.

2
00:00:03.704 --> 00:00:07.258
Localnet, test assets and generated signers.

3
00:00:07.418 --> 00:00:09.892
An edited prototype demonstration.

4
00:00:11.650 --> 00:00:14.964
BondTrace handles three corporate actions on Solana.

5
00:00:15.124 --> 00:00:18.328
This walkthrough uses captured prototype screens.

6
00:00:18.488 --> 00:00:21.922
Issuer and investor views share authoritative chain state.

7
00:00:24.650 --> 00:00:28.039
Three generated investors receive eighteen test bonds.

8
00:00:28.199 --> 00:00:31.058
Holdings begin at ten, five and three.

9
00:00:31.218 --> 00:00:34.522
All coupon and principal obligations are prefunded.

10
00:00:34.682 --> 00:00:38.251
Reserve: eighteen thousand nine hundred test units.

11
00:00:40.650 --> 00:00:44.124
At record date, transfers stop until capture.

12
00:00:44.284 --> 00:00:47.233
A complete snapshot fixes coupon rights.

13
00:00:47.393 --> 00:00:50.307
Eighteen bonds earn nine hundred test units.

14
00:00:50.467 --> 00:00:53.736
Real chain time enforces this accelerated schedule.

15
00:00:57.650 --> 00:01:00.094
Two bonds move after the snapshot.

16
00:01:00.254 --> 00:01:03.048
The first investor now holds eight bonds.

17
00:01:03.208 --> 00:01:05.972
Ten recorded bonds still earn five hundred.

18
00:01:06.132 --> 00:01:09.451
Coupon ownership survives later changes in holdings.

19
00:01:13.650 --> 00:01:16.759
Before signing, inspect the exact action.

20
00:01:16.919 --> 00:01:20.328
Check signer, recipient, network and fee.

21
00:01:20.488 --> 00:01:23.862
Simulation runs against the actual local validator.

22
00:01:24.022 --> 00:01:25.916
Generated test signer.

23
00:01:27.650 --> 00:01:30.879
Claims transfer actual test settlement tokens.

24
00:01:31.039 --> 00:01:34.153
The historical five hundred coupon is confirmed.

25
00:01:34.313 --> 00:01:36.827
Repeated coupon claims are rejected.

26
00:01:36.987 --> 00:01:40.296
Recovery reuses the original transaction signature.

27
00:01:42.650 --> 00:01:45.604
Votes use a separate immutable holder snapshot.

28
00:01:45.764 --> 00:01:48.243
The saved ballot has a ten-bond weight.

29
00:01:48.403 --> 00:01:50.912
Each voter can cast only one ballot.

30
00:01:51.072 --> 00:01:55.061
Voting is informational, without changing financial terms.

31
00:01:58.650 --> 00:02:02.289
Maturity locks transfers and fixes redemption positions.

32
00:02:02.449 --> 00:02:05.178
The positions are eight, seven and three.

33
00:02:05.338 --> 00:02:08.352
Principal totals eighteen thousand test units.

34
00:02:08.512 --> 00:02:11.846
Accelerated deadlines; idle waiting is cut.

35
00:02:14.650 --> 00:02:17.344
Principal payment and bond burn are atomic.

36
00:02:17.504 --> 00:02:19.978
All eighteen test bonds are retired.

37
00:02:20.138 --> 00:02:23.102
Remaining supply and settlement vault reach zero.

38
00:02:23.262 --> 00:02:25.821
Repeated principal claims are rejected.

39
00:02:30.650 --> 00:02:34.339
Saved integration evidence records eleven confirmed actions.

40
00:02:34.499 --> 00:02:38.773
Receipts retain signatures, slots and recovery identifiers.

41
00:02:38.933 --> 00:02:41.597
This is verified localnet evidence.

42
00:02:41.757 --> 00:02:44.661
Inspect the source and reproduce the lifecycle.

43
00:02:46.650 --> 00:02:49.564
Review the source and replay BondTrace locally.

44
00:02:49.724 --> 00:02:52.538
Judge access and submission are still pending.
